cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Barcelona Platanus Pollen-Allergen Exposure Priority (Mycorrhizal Barcelona, CRISP-DM 1-6)"
abstract: >-
  A batch geospatial pipeline that sequences Barcelona's committed plane-tree (Platanus) reduction
  by modeled pollen-allergen exposure relief. Notable for a documented, pre-registered falsification
  of its original mycorrhizal-fungi thesis at the Evaluation phase, and a measured Modifiable Areal
  Unit Problem at deployment (the exposure re-ordering result is grain-dependent).
